  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MicroMek Limited is a Malawian based hardware startup locally developing low cost autonomous fixed wing drones for delivery of remote medical diagnostics for young children and pregnant women in the hard to reach areas of Malawi and to explore cost effective ways of reducing waiting times for HIV testing of infants, in the hard to reach remote and rural areas of Malawi and Africa</narrative>
  </description>
